omarchy-msg-decree = Decree 1: all windows shall float. Tiling is counter-revolutionary.
omarchy-msg-hounds = Incoming: Systemd Hounds detected.
omarchy-msg-wave1 = Floating Windows are drifting toward the choke. Close them.
omarchy-msg-reinforce = Ghostty maintainers have sent tanks. Modal drivers included.
omarchy-msg-plan60 = The Five-Year Plan is 60% complete.
omarchy-msg-gnome = GNOME Shell is invulnerable, as usual.
omarchy-msg-gnome-cancelled = The Five-Year Plan was cancelled. GNOME Shell arrives merely annoying.
omarchy-msg-bridge = The bridge is down. Somebody force-pushed to main.
omarchy-msg-win = Windows are tiled. Order is restored.
omarchy-msg-lose = The ISO is gone. Reinstall from scratch.

